        {
          "alt": "Run history retention settings",
          "caption": "Choose a retention period or keep finished runs and events indefinitely.",
          "path": "assets/0cf7ed8c-3fc1-5d28-b89b-09ca20a59262/retention.png",
          "url": "/product-updates/assets/0cf7ed8c-3fc1-5d28-b89b-09ca20a59262/retention.png"
        }
      ],
      "contributors": [],
      "id": "0cf7ed8c-3fc1-5d28-b89b-09ca20a59262",
      "in_app": true,
      "markdown": "Choose how long to keep completed runs, events, and audit records.\n\nRun and event history defaults to 30 days, including existing installs. Choose **Keep forever** to retain older runs; deleted run details aren\u2019t archived. Existing audit archives remain indefinitely. New installs keep audits for 90 days in the database and 365 days in the archive.\n\n[Open Maintenance](/settings/maintenance)\n\n![Run history retention settings](assets/0cf7ed8c-3fc1-5d28-b89b-09ca20a59262/retention.png)",
      "published_at": "2026-10-06T22:01:18Z",
      "revision": 5,
      "sources": [
        {
          "commit": "3d678951a2d187e31139ffcdd5a4dcc5f4a98209",
          "pr": 905,
